---
description: Prevent automatic command execution
globs: ["**/*"]
alwaysApply: true
---
- Do not run any shell or CLI command automatically.
- Instead, output the exact command in a fenced code block (```bash ...```).
- Always ask the user: “Should I run this? (y/n)”.
- Only proceed when the user confirms explicitly.
- If the command is risky (migration, npm install, deploy), include a short explanation of what it does.
